      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELLSWORTH (1) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 5th (22.69) at Murray Bridge. Has a solid record over this journey. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. DIVERGENCE (2) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 17.15. Fair draw can see a good run and goes well at this distance. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from five starts. Sure to be thereabouts. ZINFANDEL EMMA (7) looks close to another win after finishing second last time (34.61) at Angle Park. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Can measure up. MISS PIPER (8) was on the bunny all the way to win last start. Must be respected.",
